OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMost UK diplomats to leave East
OL,4,AJerusalem consulate, Israel says, as
OL,5,AMiliband says 'vital services' to
OL,6,Aremain
OL,7,
OL,8,FUK Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband
OL,9,Fresponded that some staff had been
OL,10,F"temporarily withdrawn" for security
OL,11,Freasons, but stressed the mission will
OL,12,F"work with the Palestinian people".
OL,14,FIsrael said in September it would shut
OL,15,Fthe consulate, in retaliation for UK
OL,16,Fsanctions on Israeli settlements in the
OL,17,Foccupied West Bank which are illegal
OL,18,Funder international law.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
